     On success, function ddwwaarrff__ggeett__eellff() returns DW_DLV_OK.  In case of an
     error, it returns DW_DLV_ERROR and sets argument _e_r_r.

EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     To retrieve the _E_l_f instance associated with a _D_w_a_r_f___D_e_b_u_g instance use:

           Dwarf_Debug dbg;
           Dwarf_Error de;
           Elf *elf;

           ... allocate dbg using dwarf_init() etc ...

           if (dwarf_get_elf(dbg, &elf, &de) != DW_DLV_OK)
                   errx(EXIT_FAILURE, "dwarf_get_elf: %s", dwarf_errmsg(de));

